  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "133c5caa49223109",
      "translationZh": "在线评估 PP-OCRv6，然后通过 PaddlePaddle、Transformers 或 ONNX Runtime 后端集成轻量级、可用于生产环境的 OCR。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41677ad86627aff8",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 是 PaddleOCR 通用 OCR 模型家族的最新一代。它面向真实世界中的文本检测与识别，涵盖文档、屏幕截图、多语言图像、数字显示屏、工业标签和场景文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91c44d3f96a822bb",
      "translationZh": "该模型家族的参数量从 1.5M 到 34.5M 不等，分为 tiny、small 和 medium 三个档位。medium 和 small 档位支持 50 种语言，包括简体中文、繁体中文、英语、日语以及 46 种使用拉丁字母的语言。快速在线试用 PP-OCRv6：PP-OCRv6 在线演示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5a48d85192c8b0d",
      "translationZh": "在 PaddleOCR 官方内部多场景 OCR 基准测试中，PP-OCRv6_medium 的检测 Hmean 达到 86.2%，识别准确率达到 83.2%。与 PP-OCRv5_server 相比，其文本检测指标提升了 +4.6 个百分点，文本识别指标提升了 +5.1 个百分点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "005db12eeab0142f",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 聚焦于一项实际的 OCR 需求：利用小型模型和灵活的部署选项，生成准确、结构化的文本输出。如需深入了解为什么专用 OCR 模型在 VLM 时代仍然有用，请参阅我们之前的博客文章：Hugging Face 上的 PP-OCRv5：一种专用 OCR 方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "387032191db22bfb",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 有哪些新变化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d97b18064fa16a8c",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 在检测和识别两个方面引入了架构、训练和数据层面的改进。其主要设计目标是提高 OCR 准确率，同时使模型规模适合不同的部署环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "077b8957b9b8708c",
      "translationZh": "三个模型档位",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75b45e911c652379",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 提供三个模型档位，涵盖不同的模型大小和 OCR 准确率水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae6459fba62f00fe",
      "translationZh": "模型大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50c88fb32b9c00a7",
      "translationZh": "检测调和平均值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da5e818844d191b0",
      "translationZh": "识别准确率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6af99633da0b5f6",
      "translationZh": "典型应用场景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd6b674091cd8c6f",
      "translationZh": "1.5M 参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83c785186266102d",
      "translationZh": "边缘设备、轻量级本地 OCR、延迟敏感型演示、资源受限环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b88602ec8f57d5c",
      "translationZh": "7.7M 参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb7a90cccee80c99",
      "translationZh": "移动端、桌面端、均衡型 OCR 服务、计算成本更低的多语言 OCR",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5fabe1721546d03",
      "translationZh": "34.5M 参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe2b8deb32747078",
      "translationZh": "准确率优先的 OCR、服务端流水线、工业 OCR、文档摄取、多语言 OCR",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "938a8c5e7d239410",
      "translationZh": "PPLCNetV4 骨干网络",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b51856701eb14167",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 使用 PPLCNetV4 作为文本检测和文本识别的统一骨干网络。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28a6bdc6a8e646c4",
      "translationZh": "对开发者而言，主要优势在于整个模型家族的一致性。tiny、small 和 medium 这三个档位并非互不相关的模型；它们属于同一个 OCR 家族，采用共同的架构方向。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ce673b755990d34e",
      "translationZh": "用于文本检测的 RepLKFPN",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b7a4fbd31d87625",
      "translationZh": "文本检测是 OCR 流水线的第一阶段。检测质量会影响发送给识别器的裁剪图像，而质量不佳的裁剪图像往往会导致更差的识别结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a299c6fde08c1af",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 使用 RepLKFPN 升级了检测模块。RepLKFPN 是一种轻量级大卷积核特征金字塔网络，专为多尺度文本检测而设计，同时保持高效推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "122a7b698cd07da9",
      "translationZh": "这对于现实场景中的 OCR 输入很有意义，因为其中的文本可能很小、密集、发生旋转、分辨率低，或嵌在复杂背景中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0efdd8928684de43",
      "translationZh": "用于识别的 EncoderWithLightSVTR",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b3b454111411073",
      "translationZh": "在文本识别方面，PP-OCRv6 使用 EncoderWithLightSVTR。它将局部上下文建模与全局注意力相结合，以提升对具有挑战性的文本裁剪图像的识别质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4be133f91ce0f2e3",
      "translationZh": "识别能力的改进对多语言文本、屏幕文本、工业字符、特殊符号、密集文本以及含噪图像区域尤为重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a91ec92f42d1b368",
      "translationZh": "统一的多语言 OCR",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "482042bba59b0aea",
      "translationZh": "中型和小型规格在同一模型系列中支持 50 种语言，涵盖简体中文、繁体中文、英语、日语以及 46 种使用拉丁字母的语言。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e339fe044152d708",
      "translationZh": "这有助于减少常见多语言 OCR 场景对多个独立 OCR 模型的需求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1e1d6937b22d0daa",
      "translationZh": "PaddleOCR 快速入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49b24386833238f8",
      "translationZh": "安装 PaddleOCR：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6727429ea8bd436",
      "translationZh": "使用 Paddle Infernece（默认后端）运行 OCR：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fe0384a978d96be",
      "translationZh": "OCR 结果可以保存为可视化图像和结构化 JSON 输出。随后，结构化输出可供文档解析、搜索、信息提取、RAG、分析或智能体工作流等下游系统使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9a91d931310c30c1",
      "translationZh": "可用的推理后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b2c41715f89d0af",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 可以通过 PaddleOCR 使用多种推理后端。PaddleOCR 3.7 提供了统一的推理引擎接口，其中 engine 用于选择底层运行时，相关配置可通过流水线或模块 API 传入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fb4019a35e427e8",
      "translationZh": "后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "526e0087cc3f254d",
      "translationZh": "说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "033549df9ef8f5e6",
      "translationZh": "变换器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ece7774dbbda041c",
      "translationZh": "面向 Hugging Face / PyTorch 的推理路径，适用于受支持的 PaddleOCR 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaa6c0aa94cd3730",
      "translationZh": "适用于基于 ONNX 的部署环境的可移植推理路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "528e54bbe6d9f7fd",
      "translationZh": "原生 Paddle 推理格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1874bf7de16eb55",
      "translationZh": "对于 Hugging Face 用户，PaddleOCR 支持使用 Transformers 后端运行部分 OCR 和文档解析模型。可通过以下方式启用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b76ba0d44ce00cf9",
      "translationZh": "有关 Transformers 后端在 PaddleOCR 中如何工作的更多详情，请参阅：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44f2734c69c4dcb1",
      "translationZh": "PaddleOCR：使用 Transformers 后端运行 OCR 和文档解析任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0b76cf4663c22ed",
      "translationZh": "使用 Transformer 后端运行 PP-OCRv6 的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "278f7a614f09f496",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 Collection 中也提供了 ONNX 变体，适用于通过 engine=\"onnxruntime\" 使用 ONNX Runtime 的环境：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6e012a7c9d32eb1",
      "translationZh": "这些后端选项共同使 PP-OCRv6 能够在不同的运行时环境中使用，同时在 Hugging Face Hub 上保持相同的 OCR 模型系列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63ac6075925d2507",
      "translationZh": "PP-OCRv6 为 PaddleOCR 扩充了一个轻量级、多语言 OCR 模型系列，用于真实场景中的文本检测与识别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "beb25bd7a7814022",
      "translationZh": "此次发布包含三个档位的模型，参数量从 1.5M 到 34.5M 不等，支持多达 50 种语言的 OCR，检测和识别准确率较 PP-OCRv5_server 有所提升，并在 Hugging Face Hub 上提供多种模型格式，包括 safetensors、Paddle 推理模型和 ONNX 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5487b0b970fd7787",
      "translationZh": "结合托管的 Hugging Face Space 和可用的 PaddleOCR 推理后端，PP-OCRv6 为评估和集成提供了多个入口：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf4a1612c3425e28",
      "translationZh": "在线演示：PP-OCRv6 在线演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f4f6e8512b9b7db",
      "translationZh": "模型合集：PP-OCRv6 合集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e76af2c1145b342b",
      "translationZh": "Transformers 后端博客：使用 Transformers 后端的 PaddleOCR",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
